  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/gorc1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review (dev 100b6fbb6e): fixture with Cargo.toml [dependencies] serde_json gives boundary node rust:serde_json::Value with no directness, while a go.mod control stamps direct. supply_chain.py LANGUAGE_PACKAGE_SCHEME is still {elixir, javascript, typescript}. Since 3c53837bb5 (INV-fuhin) the TOML declaration node Cargo.toml:serde_json is stamped direct, but Rust boundary nodes are not. MECHANISM: no Cargo reader and no rust package scheme in DependencyManifest.directness_for. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-totob."  # 3669
